[{"title":"从郑少嘉求贡纲馀茶 其一","author":"张栻","text":"贡包馀璧小盘龙，独占人间第一功。\n乞与清风行万里，为君一洗瘴云空。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":54821,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"从郑少嘉求贡纲馀茶 其二","author":"张栻","text":"茗事萧疏五岭中，修仁但可愈头风。\n春前龙焙令人忆，知与故人风味同。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":54822,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"元日","author":"张栻","text":"古史书元意义存，春秋揭示更分明。\n人心天理初无欠，正本端原万善生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":54823,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"方广圣灯","author":"张栻","text":"阴壑传闻炯夜灯，几人高閤费追寻。\n山间光景祇常事，堪笑尘寰万种心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":54824,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"方广寺睡觉","author":"张栻","text":"僧舍孤衾寄此情，庄生梦破晓钟声。\n浮沤踪迹原无定，惆怅西风一夜清。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":54825,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"方广道中半岭少憩","author":"张栻","text":"半岭篮舆小驻肩，眼中已觉渺云烟。\n山头更尽无穷境，非是人间别有天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":54826,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"丙申至前五日复坐南窗忆去年诗又成两章 其二","author":"张栻","text":"新晴物物有春意，正值一阳来复时。\n变化无穷俱是易，探原密处起乾知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":54827,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"丙申至前五日复坐南窗忆去年诗又成两章 其一","author":"张栻","text":"依然红日照窗楣，还是去年消息时。\n妙理不须寻辙迹，只于生处验新知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":54828,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"叶夷中屡以书求予记敬斋予往年尝为亲旧为记及铭矣今独成两绝句寄之 其一","author":"张栻","text":"聪明用处翻多暗，机巧萌时正自痴。\n若识圣门持敬味，临深履薄更何之。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":54829,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"叶夷中屡以书求予记敬斋予往年尝为亲旧为记及铭矣今独成两绝句寄之 其二","author":"张栻","text":"向来屡著敬斋语，正恐多言意未明。\n今日报君惟一句，工夫端的贵躬行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":54830,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"四月四日饮吴仲立家海桐花下吴伯承以事不至寄诗来次韵","author":"张栻","text":"翠盖亭边春色归，还来把酒及开时。\n坐无车公欢意少，犹得风前读好诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":54831,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"平时兄弟间十三章章四句送定叟弟之官桂林 其一","author":"张栻","text":"平时兄弟间，未省别离味。\n别时已不堪，别后何由慰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":54832,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"平时兄弟间十三章章四句送定叟弟之官桂林 其十三","author":"张栻","text":"子行日以远，我思日以长。\n政或少閒暇，书来不可忘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":54833,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"正月强半梅犹未开黄仲秉作诗嘲之次韵 其一","author":"张栻","text":"孤芳未分落人间，故向东风小作难。\n眼底莫容蜂蝶乱，好留明月趁春寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":54834,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"正月强半梅犹未开黄仲秉作诗嘲之次韵 其二","author":"张栻","text":"水边疏影几人知，尚喜诗翁到未迟。\n怪得寻花心眼别，去年曾赋上林枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":54835,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"龙孙竹生辰阳山谷间高不盈尺细仅如针而凡所以为竹者无一不具予寘石斛中暮春生数笋森然可喜为赋此","author":"张栻","text":"小竹如针能具体，方春茁笋更堪怜。\n乾坤妙用无馀欠，隐几旁观为莞然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":54836,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"仲秉再用前韵为梅解嘲复和之 其一","author":"张栻","text":"几年身在水云间，愈见花边下语难。\n犹有故人相慰藉，西山载酒未盟寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":54837,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"仲秉再用前韵为梅解嘲复和之 其二","author":"张栻","text":"东君岂是结新知，谁共群芳较疾迟。\n不但开花高一世，更看嘉实满青枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":54838,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"仲春有怀 其三","author":"张栻","text":"老木高枝不可攀，玉泉飞出半崖间。\n如何借得清冷水，一洗疮痍为解颜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":54839,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"仲春有怀 其五","author":"张栻","text":"想见城南春水深，春来夜夜动归心。\n隔墙季子应无恙，为托飞鸿寄好音。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":54840,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"仲春有怀 其四","author":"张栻","text":"楚翠亭边花正开，道乡台下石崔嵬。\n主人今有此客否，客亦思君日百回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":54841,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"仲春有怀 其二","author":"张栻","text":"西湖景物元潇洒，杨柳新来两岸垂。\n亦有游人往来否，不应闲过看花时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":54842,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"仲春有怀 其一","author":"张栻","text":"青山四面拥江城，暮角声中淡月明。\n自倚阑干生白发，无心行乐趁春晴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":54843,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再和","author":"张栻","text":"想得经行与客俱，身强宁复要人扶。\n晚来山色应难尽，十里青苍看有无。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":54844,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"岁晚烹试小春建茶","author":"张栻","text":"阳月藏春妙莫窥，灵芽粟粒露全机。\n煮泉独啜寒窗夜，已觉东风天际归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":54845,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"有怀安国","author":"张栻","text":"若人别去已经秋，却见山间翰墨留。\n独对西风揩望眼，试从云际辨荆州。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":54846,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵无为使君尊兄见寄之什","author":"张栻","text":"江山接境相望近，风雨一春音问疏。\n安得从公苕霅上，幅巾一叶卧看书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":54847,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵刘枢密 其一","author":"张栻","text":"朔风漠漠低黄云，晓看缤纷万鹤群。\n为应农祥眉一展，更将馀力付斯文。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":54848,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵刘枢密 其二","author":"张栻","text":"燕寝凝香意自长，不须乘月据胡床。\n新正更喜身强健，和气都归柏子觞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":54849,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵许深父 其二","author":"张栻","text":"西山老木正亭亭，云影参差阴复晴。\n手卷残书天欲暮，闻君剥啄叩门声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":54850,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵许深父 其一","author":"张栻","text":"日日经行只小园，静支邛竹听鸣泉。\n此时心事何人共，素壁题诗第几篇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":54851,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵许深父 其五","author":"张栻","text":"年中一稔愿无馀，渐喜微呼息里胥。\n赢得闲身学农圃，未妨斜日带经锄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":54852,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵许深父 其三","author":"张栻","text":"却下斜坡并柳堤，双飞燕子正衔泥。\n纷纷风雨春将半，渌涨平湖桥柱低。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":54853,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵许深父 其四","author":"张栻","text":"下瞰寒江百尺坡，小松新种也婆娑。\n栽培拟待凌云日，眼底浮花奈若何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":54854,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵范至能峡中见寄","author":"张栻","text":"合绾丝纶对紫薇，却扪青壁听猿啼。\n祇应许国心金石，蜀道如天亦可梯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":54855,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵赵漕 其二","author":"张栻","text":"雨声历历来庭户，喜色津津到泽虞。\n击壤径思同野老，名亭讵敢学坡苏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":54856,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵赵漕 其一","author":"张栻","text":"中宵忧岁不成寐，一雨为霖敢自虞。\n应是行台借馀润，故教均泽及樵苏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path