寿定叟弟 其二","author":"张栻","text":"闻说严人爱贰车，呻吟赴愬赖携扶。\n从今充扩应无倦，千里疲民待子苏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":54876,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寿定叟弟 其五","author":"张栻","text":"年年桂绽菊开时，长忆芳樽共一卮。\n请诵周人和乐句，全胜三叹陟冈诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":54877,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寿定叟弟 其四","author":"张栻","text":"秋风想已治归装，吾亦扁舟具碧湘。\n世味祇应谙历遍，何如兄弟对方床。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":54878,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寿定叟弟 其三","author":"张栻","text":"闻说年来更老成，清心寡欲厌纷纭。\n固知造物有深意，端享修龄看策勋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":54879,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寿定叟弟 其二","author":"张栻","text":"堂堂自昔源流远，衮衮方来事业长。\n驷马安车遵大道，正须缓辔不须忙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":54880,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"庐陵李直卿以复名其斋求予诗久未暇也今日雪霁登楼偶得此遂书以赠顾惟圣门精微纲领岂浅陋所能发祇增三叹 其一","author":"张栻","text":"李侯索我复斋诗，此理难明信者稀。\n要识圣贤端的意，须于动处见天机。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":54881,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"庐陵李直卿以复名其斋求予诗久未暇也今日雪霁登楼偶得此遂书以赠顾惟圣门精微纲领岂浅陋所能发祇增三叹 其二","author":"张栻","text":"万化根原天地心，几人于此费追寻。\n端倪不远君看取，妙用何曾间古今。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":54882,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和元晦马迹桥","author":"张栻","text":"便请行从马迹桥，何须乘鹤簉丛霄。\n殷勤底事登临去，不为山僧苦见招。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":54883,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和元晦方广版屋","author":"张栻","text":"葺盖非陶埴，年深自碧差。\n如何乱心曲，不忍诵秦诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":54884,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和元晦怀定叟戏作","author":"张栻","text":"路入青山小作程，每逢佳处忆吾人。\n山林朝市休关念，认取临深履薄身。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":54885,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和元晦咏画壁","author":"张栻","text":"松杉夹路自清阴，溪水有源谁复寻。\n忽见画图开四壁，悠然端亦慰予心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":54886,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和元晦咏雪","author":"张栻","text":"兀坐竹舆穿涧壑，仰看石径接烟霞。\n是间故有春消息，散作千林琼玉花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":54887,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和元晦林间残雪之韵","author":"张栻","text":"眼中光洁尽琼瑶，未觉郁蓝宫殿遥。\n石壁长林冰箸落，锵然玉佩响层霄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":54888,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和元晦晚霞","author":"张栻","text":"早来雪意遮空碧，晚喜晴霞散绮红。\n便可悬知明旦事，一轮明月快哉风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":54889,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和元晦雪压竹韵","author":"张栻","text":"山行景物总清奇，知费山翁几许诗。\n雪急风号联骑日，月明霜净倚阑时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":54890,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和元晦醉下祝融","author":"张栻","text":"云气飘飘御晚风，笑谈嘘吸满心胸。\n须臾敛尽还空碧，露出天边无数峰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":54891,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和安国送茶","author":"张栻","text":"官焙苍云小卧龙，使君分饷自题封。\n打门惊起曲肱梦，公案从今又一重。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":54892,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和朱元晦韵","author":"张栻","text":"一见琼山眼为青，马蹄不觉渡沙汀。\n如今谁是王摩诘，为写清新入画屏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":54893,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和张荆州所寄 其三","author":"张栻","text":"有时散策过西邻，共向东风忆故人。\n芙蓉亭下池水满，敬简堂前杨柳春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":54894,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和张荆州所寄 其一","author":"张栻","text":"自古荆州通陆海，祇今学士过青钱。\n笑谭坐了安边策，取次成诗尽可编。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":54895,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和张荆州所寄 其四","author":"张栻","text":"钟陵未命千里驾，洞庭亦系沙边舟。\n闭门读书卧岁晚，世事敢云风马牛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":54896,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和张荆州所寄 其五","author":"张栻","text":"明时未可废谭兵，壮岁宁容便乞身。\n何人为向沙头去，凭仗慇勤一问津。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":54897,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}}]